ねぇ朝帰りしたりしちゃいわゆ? どう?
Hey, why don't we stay out all night? How about it?

340
00:32:15,869 --> 00:32:17,569
なぁもう我慢できん!
Ah, I can't stand it anymore!

341
00:32:17,569 --> 00:32:19,269
pain, pain 痛いってば everyday
Pain, pain, it hurts everyday

342
00:32:19,369 --> 00:32:21,869
ま、ゆーていけるけどなブルベ夏なんて関係ないな^^
Well, I can get by, but summer type doesn't matter at all^^

343
00:32:22,069 --> 00:32:24,269
誰よりもネコ節操ない! も結構
More than anyone, I have no integrity! That's fine too

344
