両極のど真ん中狙い撃ってお願い勇気を御拝借
And aim for the very middle of the two extremes, so please give me courage...

444
00:39:03,609 --> 00:39:10,049
疑わしい相手なら何時だって自分ずーっと進化したいのね答え合わせ
If it's a suspicious opponent, then I want to evolve forever. Let's check our answers

445
00:39:11,949 --> 00:39:17,499
あなたを知る程僕は正されて行く捨てたもんじゃない只生きようとして
The more I know you, the more I'm corrected. That's pretty impressive; I'll just try living

446
00:39:22,129 --> 00:39:24,609
主義をもって利益を成した場合ほ
When profit is accomplished as a principle,

447
00:39:27,299 --> 00:39:31,099
商いが食い扶持以上の意味を宿す
Business has more meaning than the cost of one's food

448
00:39:32,529 --> 00:39:37,079
義務と権利双方を重んじつつ飽くまで
While honoring both duty and rights,

449
00:39:38,369 --> 00:39:41,889
両者割合は曖昧にして居たい
I want to keep both ratios vague until the bitter end

450
00:39:43,199 --> 00:39:52,659
あなたを想うたび僕は許されて行く夢とうつつを繋いで
Whenever I think of you, I'm excused, binding together my dreams and reality

451
00:40:00,510 --> 00:40:04,490
きっとそろばん抱えたら そのばん弾いて
If you hold an abacus, strike it right then and there.

452
00:40:11,210 --> 00:40:14,490
両極のど真ん中 狙い撃って
Aim right down the middle of both extremes.

453
00:40:15,470 --> 00:40:20,190
お願い 勇気をくれ
I beg you, give me courage.

454
00:40:28,210 --> 00:40:35,930
いつだって自分 ずっと進化したいよね
No matter what, you always want to keep evolving, right?

455
00:40:36,850 --> 00:40:42,630
答え合わせ 貴方を知るほど 僕は正されて行く
Checking our answers, the more I know you, the more I'm corrected.

456
00:40:44,350 --> 00:40:53,430
僕はただされてく すべてかものじゃ無い ただ生きようと
I'm just being corrected, not that everything is certain—just trying to live.

457
00:40:54,770 --> 00:41:00,950
息をとおして...
Breathing through...

458
00:41:47,250 --> 00:41:48,530
うわー！
Whoa!

459
